      "text": "@GoogleDeepMind Clever teacher for PARDIG… it learns from the rain radar on NASA's GPM satellite, which only sees a narrow strip of Earth on each pass, then fills in the whole globe every 15 minutes from the cloud pictures 🤯\nOver 30% better at spotting light to moderate rain than NASA's IMERG,",
