          "impression_count": 55487,
          "like_count": 580,
          "quote_count": 54,
          "reply_count": 162,
          "retweet_count": 81
        },
        "text": "Accurate weather forecasting starts with how clearly we can observe the atmosphere in real-time. 🌍\n\nThat’s why we’re releasing PARDIG and SatWeave - the foundational datasets behind WeatherNext 3 - to help researchers and developers build new climate applications 🧵 https://t.co/fHR0BOSnnM"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "4783690002",
        "created_at": "2026-11-13T13:12:44.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "2121229777835089974"
        ],
        "id": "2121229777835089974",
        "in_reply_to_user_id": "4783690002",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 12,
          "impression_count": 18338,
          "like_count": 76,
          "quote_count": 0,
          "reply_count": 10,
          "retweet_count": 5
        },
        "referenced_tweets": [
          {
            "id": "2121229774865527097",
            "type": "replied_to"
          }
        ],
        "text": "What’s under the hood:\n🌧️ PARDIG: Estimates global rainfall every 15 minutes, while improving precipitation detection skill by more than 30%.\n🛰️ SatWeave: Combines several geostationary satellites into one live view of Earth’s clouds and storms every 60 minutes. https://t.co/QBBilyCLyQ"
      }
